{"text": "It was a dark autumn night. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And the old banker. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Was walking up and down his study. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He was remembering a party. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He had given. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Fifteen years before. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Many clever people had been there. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And they had talked. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> About the death penalty. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Most of the guests thought. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> That the death penalty was wrong. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And should be replaced. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> By life in prison. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I disagree. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Said the banker. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The death penalty is kinder. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Than life in prison. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> An execution kills a man. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> At once but life in prison. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Kills him slowly. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Which is more humane. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To kill you in a few minutes. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Or to take your life away. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Over many years. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Among the guests. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Was a young lawyer. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Of about twenty five. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Both are wrong, he said. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But if I had to choose. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I would choose life in prison. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To live in any way. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Is better. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Than not to live at all.", "alignment": {"characters": ["I", "t", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "a", " ", "d", "a", "r", "k", " ", "a", "u", "t", "u", "m", "n", " ", "n", "i", "g", "h", "t", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "A", "n", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "o", "l", "d", " ", "b", "a", "n", "k", "e", "r", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"